RTL8198C / GN866 AC — experimental OpenWrt 24.10 port
=====================================================

This directory is an initial target-registration scaffold only.

Known blockers before a bootable image can be claimed:
- Linux 6.6 needs verified RTL8198C/Lexra CPU, interrupt-controller, timer,
  UART, memory-controller and SoC support.
- The GN866 AC DTS must be validated against the board's real memory map and
  peripherals; placeholder register addresses must not be treated as verified.
- The board's SPI flash partition map and vendor firmware header/checksum
  format must be confirmed before defining a factory image.
- The legacy rt-loader board source is not yet integrated into the image build.

Do not flash generated experimental images to hardware until these items are
implemented and verified.
